be really tough to say no to.

00:11:20.085 --> 00:11:22.726
So I would say that,
because it's of the moment.

00:11:23.839 --> 00:11:25.691
- Really, not mainstream cable or network,

00:11:25.691 --> 00:11:26.232
or anything like that?

00:11:26.232 --> 00:11:28.256
- No, because I'd rather
go to where the pucks going

00:11:28.256 --> 00:11:31.633
