of the narrative of,

00:11:31.633 --> 00:11:33.538
you know those shows, House of Cards,

00:11:33.538 --> 00:11:36.057
Orange is the New Black,
whatever sports deal they do,

00:11:36.057 --> 00:11:37.299
and then that business show.

00:11:37.299 --> 00:11:39.641
That's where they competed
with CNBC, ya know?

00:11:39.641 --> 00:11:41.330
- That's what I did with the
podcast, I saw the opportunity.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.233
- Yeah, that's exactly right.

00:11:42.233 --> 00:11:43.070
And that's where the upside is,

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.049
you wait and you let the puck come to you.

00:11:45.049 --> 00:11:48.735
I would say CNBC and Bloomberg
are interesting to me

00:11:48.735 --> 00:11:50.998
because it's just right
down the pipe of business.

00:11:52.588 --> 00:11:55.212
Yeah, I just can't get there.

