00:12:19.111 --> 00:12:19.811
- B?

00:12:19.811 --> 00:12:21.251
- B!

00:12:21.251 --> 00:12:24.004
- [Voiceover] B asks, "How do
you deal with losing a client?

00:12:24.004 --> 00:12:26.812
"Just lost one and I'm mad as hell."

00:12:26.812 --> 00:12:28.732
- Yeah, mad as hell is good.

00:12:28.732 --> 00:12:30.666
I think mad as hell is appropriate.

00:12:31.836 --> 00:12:33.986
When I lose a client, the
first thing that I think about

00:12:33.986 --> 00:12:36.819
is what did I do wrong?

00:12:36.819 --> 00:12:39.268
And then, most of the
time I have an answer.

00:12:39.268 --> 00:12:41.207
If I don't have an answer,
I try to figure it out.

00:12:41.207 --> 00:12:43.088
But, I'm pretty interesting

00:12:43.088 --> 00:12:45.073
when it comes to losing a client.

00:12:45.073 --> 00:12:47.986
I'm very much onto the next one.

00:12:48.965 --> 00:12:51.074
I on the other hand am very lucky.

00:12:51.074 --> 00:12:52.108
Listening to you is really interesting.

00:12:52.108 --> 00:12:53.490
I was sitting here and saying my god,

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:56.566
my ability to dump and
move on in any situation,

00:12:56.566 --> 00:12:59.143
relationships, business,
it's the game for me.

00:12:59.143 --> 00:13:01.096
It's why I'm always in a good mood.

00:13:01.096 --> 00:13:04.327
I literally sit on bad news and bad stuff

00:13:04.327 --> 00:13:06.329
