and what makes a good person

00:20:37.014 --> 00:20:39.464
and what makes a good
person and a bad person,

00:20:39.464 --> 00:20:43.991
fundamentally changes with
the great data breach of 2022.

00:20:43.991 --> 00:20:46.649
